WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.610
Open the Service Queue.

2
00:00:03.710 --> 00:00:07.779
Tap the kart that needs a service.

3
00:00:07.879 --> 00:00:11.148
Tap Start service.

4
00:00:11.248 --> 00:00:16.748
Tap each check to mark it Good.

5
00:00:23.426 --> 00:00:28.926
Type the readings where asked.

6
00:00:56.271 --> 00:01:01.771
Add any part you fitted.

7
00:01:06.718 --> 00:01:11.448
Tap Complete service.

8
00:01:11.548 --> 00:01:17.048
Tick the declaration and confirm.

9
00:01:18.130 --> 00:01:23.630
The kart is Ready again.
